                                                "text": "the glimmering dawn    a glimmering lamp"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c94c828-5ac2-4307-aa5a-a688e0283079",
                                                "sense_id": "99ea8df2-e2ac-3a64-baa4-2ef7ff1e50ff",
                                                "text": "The fireflies glimmered in the dark."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c186582-4913-4cf5-a1e4-2530bee6836c",
                                                "sense_id": "99ea8df2-e2ac-3a64-baa4-2ef7ff1e50ff",
                                                "text": "The west yet glimmers with some streaks of day."
